&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You are hired ahead of your team. Several seats sit open beneath this role, and you get to shape and staff them rather than inherit someone else’s structure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Marketing is being built into a measurable engine, and demand generation is the&amp;nbsp;centre&amp;nbsp;of it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Modulr&amp;nbsp;is the&amp;nbsp;payments&amp;nbsp;automation platform that streamlines money movement with accuracy, control and reliability, built to scale. We process more than 200m transactions and over £180bn in payment value on an&amp;nbsp;annualised&amp;nbsp;basis, and we are trusted by over 6,000 businesses from fast-growing SMEs to global enterprises.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We automate how money moves into and out of a business (payroll, supplier payments, spend management and payment collection) through a single platform, connected to the accounting and payroll systems finance teams already use, and underpinned by principal memberships of Visa and Mastercard and direct access to central bank infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a regulated payments provider with over a decade of experience, we are the platform finance teams trust to run mission-critical operations.&amp;nbsp;Modulr&amp;nbsp;is backed by PayPal, FIS, General Atlantic, Blenheim&amp;nbsp;Chalcot, Frog&amp;nbsp;Capital&amp;nbsp;and Highland Europe, with over 400 employees across London, Edinburgh,&amp;nbsp;Amsterdam&amp;nbsp;and Mumbai.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Find out more about us on our website and careers site.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You will own demand generation across&amp;nbsp;Modulr’s&amp;nbsp;priority verticals: Travel, Lending, corporate business&amp;nbsp;payments&amp;nbsp;and SME/accountants. There is a capable team in place and real momentum in the business. Your opportunity is to bring it together into one system, with a shared plan, a clear definition of great and an operating rhythm that turns activity into&amp;nbsp;predictable&amp;nbsp;pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is a build, and that is the best part of it. Two vertical owners sit in the team&amp;nbsp;today&amp;nbsp;and a senior events hire is in process. Beyond that, the shape of the function is yours to fill: an SME and accountant specialist, partner and channel marketing, a dedicated outbound capability, and events support behind your events lead. You are hired first precisely so that you can define those roles and&amp;nbsp;hire into&amp;nbsp;them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The business is varied, with several products, multiple priority&amp;nbsp;verticals&amp;nbsp;and two routes to market that behave very differently. The enterprise and mid-market motion&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;sales-led and considered. The SME motion runs&amp;nbsp;largely through&amp;nbsp;accountants, who introduce their own clients, and it is high volume and&amp;nbsp;partner-shaped. Running both well is&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;interesting part of this job.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own the number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;You will carry the quarterly pipeline commitment across the verticals, know your conversion rates and cost per meeting, and be able to defend them in front of the exec team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Run the verticals as pods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Each vertical pairs a demand generation owner with a product marketer working as one unit. You will lead that model, and&amp;nbsp;most likely own&amp;nbsp;a vertical yourself, because leaders here do the work as well as direct it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Take paid acquisition to the next level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Build rigorous testing and experimentation across paid search and social so every pound works&amp;nbsp;harder, and&amp;nbsp;hold agency partners to clear goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Grow events into a pipeline channel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Modulr&amp;nbsp;already has a strong presence at the events that matter. You will turn that into a deliberate, measured channel with capture targets set in advance and conversion tracked after.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build the SME and accountant motion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;The one materially different funnel we run: high volume, partner-adjacent, and closer to enabling accountants to bring us their clients than to a direct sale. It deserves its own playbook rather than a scaled-down enterprise one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Stand up&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;outbound capability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Build the outbound engine alongside the sales development&amp;nbsp;team, and&amp;nbsp;hold a single shared pipeline goal with sales rather than an argument about sources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build and lead the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Define the seats, hire them, and develop the people already here so they do the best work of their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Make AI part of how the team works&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Workflows and agents that compress campaign cycles and let a focused team do the work of a much larger one. We will ask you to show us this during the process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
