&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Modulr has been changing the face of payments in the UK and Europe for 10 years and is leveraging this depth of capability to fuel the next phase of its global expansion into the US. This presents an opportunity for a driven, ambitious and hands-on Senior Product Manager to help us scale Modulr’s US payments proposition. If you want to help us execute on our US strategy in a high leverage product role, keep reading.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
